  "name": "The stone circle",
  "region": "wickers_vigil",
  "summary": "Nine standing stones round a bonfire, chains melded into six of them, masked dancers capering in the firelight.",
  "text": "Nine standing stones stand in a ring with a bonfire at the heart of it, runes burning orange along their edges. Chains run out of the rock to six figures kneeling at its foot. Round them, dozens of dancers in animal masks sway to a hymn that has no words you can hold on to, and in the middle of the song, one of them turns and waves.",
